cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "LLM Vuln Scanner"
abstract: >-
  An automated vulnerability scanner for LLM applications. Probes for prompt injection,
  hidden context exposure, sensitive information disclosure, improper output handling,
  excessive agency, encoding attacks, jailbreak templates on fictional canary tasks and
  token blow-up are scored with canary, sink emulation and refusal detectors, and findings
  are mapped to the OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2026, the OWASP Top 10 for Agentic
  Applications 2026 and MITRE ATLAS v2026.10, with JSON, HTML, SARIF and JUnit reports.
authors:
